rac{3}{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a-6b &=0 \\\\ 2a-7b &=5 \\\\ 2a-4b &=-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 \\\\ 2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262954 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "185b4e95-b4a0-5de8-9261-d542718f5c47" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260089} {:answer/id #uuid "78034341-3742-5248-aca4-b79ea92704b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & 6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260925} {:answer/id #uuid "a173e8eb-2a72-58f0-92da-3bede70514f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & -6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261278} {:answer/id #uuid "c9186076-0cb5-5afc-b113-09a238657b5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261653} {:answer/id #uuid "dcde83ec-9e11-55f5-909d-64911ec61004" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answ