stem is already organized so that the variables are in the order $u,v$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186524334 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7ea54f46-cd9d-5f1a-8e7d-0bb9d5e691b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 7 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -12 & 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524341} {:answer/id #uuid "9762c4ad-74fe-5f46-ab05-155041c4f0c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -12 & 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524346} {:answer/id #uuid "b28fc242-5911-5dee-851c-180ffc4d677d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524349} {:answer/id #uuid "c89de38b-bfde-5ef4-aeb6-68f3fecf7bd3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524352} {:answer/id #uuid "de60478b-74f8-522b-91a1-135db37da9ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 7 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524358}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186524352} :answer-field/id #uuid "819139e3-9730-5d16-ae93-5334345832d3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524343}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "46d3999d-feca-57b7-832c-c953e5a39c71" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{2}+7{x}_{1} &=2{x}_{3} \\\\ -12{x}_{3} &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}7{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}-2{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 0{x}_{1}+0{x}_{2}-12{x}_{3} &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -12\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186524339 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "452a2c44-7316-5a22-b38c-9472d5277b1e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 14 \\\\ -7 & -5 & 0 & -7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524333} {:answer/id #uuid "52fb4ff5-e6f6-500c-b68b-1f0e9bc219ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -14 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 7 & -7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524336} {:answer/id #uuid "71628b15-6d40-5ac1-874b-5bb32e0fe7cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & 14 \\\\ 7 & -5 & -7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524337} {:answer/id #uuid "c58bc993-c1a0-522b-a770-d35e63a11ebc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & -1 & 14 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 7 & -7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524351} {:answer/id #uuid "dbbec889-e859-5f63-89a1-795e2ff0b381" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -14 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 7 & 7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524356}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186524336} :answe