 system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+0y &=6 \\\\ 9x+4y &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262932 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01298fa9-116c-5e33-baa5-a0ae76ef2898" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & \\,\\,\\,-8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 9 & 0 \\\\ 3 & \\,\\,\\,-1 & \\,\\,\\,-8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186259882} {:answer/id #uuid "132976d4-8895-55cc-90d5-07367fb1f532" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & \\,\\,\\,-8 & 1 & \\,\\,\\,-1 \\\\ 0 & 9 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 3 & \\,\\,\\,-1 & \\,\\,\\,-8 & \\,\\,\\,-4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260045} {:answer/id #uuid "327bc065-76c2-56dd-b2d1-eafb7da75193" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & \\,\\,\\,-8 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 9 & 1 \\\\ 3 & \\,\\,\\,-1 & \\,\\,\\,-8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260329} {:answer/id #uuid "80718f1b-1a50-5aac-9462-f6ea97b68d58" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & \\,\\,\\,-8 & 1 & \\,\\,-1 \\\\ 0 & 9 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 3 & \\,\\,\\,-1 & \\,\\,\\,-8 & \\,\\,-4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260992} {:answer/id #uuid "858a6da7-fe73-57b2-b3aa-056f9fb57a36" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & \\,\\,\\,-8 & 1 \\\\ 9 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & \\,\\,\\,-1 & \\,\\,\\,-8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261033}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259882} :answer-field/id #uuid "00535bb2-7345-5c5d-bdf8-1f25dbd0f3ae" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262122}] :question/difficulty 