d #uuid "1822f3b9-1c46-5159-80d2-c54e1e2abf48" :question/math-academy-id "q-129146" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n &=11 \\\\ 0 &=4n-8 \\\\ n &=-6m+\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $m,n$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n &=11 \\\\ 0m-4n &=-8 \\\\ 6m+n &=\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338979 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "295a8105-5ca7-5ca5-bb2d-077d03e93316" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336417} {:answer/id #uuid "29c449bb-9934-5c52-8f09-9d20678309a6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336419} {:answer/id #uuid "56960842-9c7f-5a1b-8950-51ca9b31964e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336828} {:answer/id #uuid "8f449dbb-3b0c-5f6d-b4f6-33394bc3ec89" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 175921863373