ligned}7{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}-2{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 0{x}_{1}+0{x}_{2}-12{x}_{3} &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -12\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186524339 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "452a2c44-7316-5a22-b38c-9472d5277b1e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 14 \\\\ -7 & -5 & 0 & -7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524333} {:answer/id #uuid "52fb4ff5-e6f6-500c-b68b-1f0e9bc219ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -14 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 7 & -7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524336} {:answer/id #uuid "71628b15-6d40-5ac1-874b-5bb32e0fe7cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & 14 \\\\ 7 & -5 & -7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524337} {:answer/id #uuid "c58bc993-c1a0-522b-a770-d35e63a11ebc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & -1 & 14 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 7 & -7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524351} {:answer/id #uuid "dbbec889-e859-5f63-89a1-795e2ff0b381" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -14 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 7 & 7\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524356}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186524336} :answer-field/id #uuid "77477f59-6d6c-5c9d-bb90-019a37bbb1aa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524340}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "747811c9-1d46-520c-89bf-5eb46cd226f1" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a-c &=14b \\\\ 7c-5a &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}1a-14b-1c &=0 \\\\ -5a+0b+7c &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -14 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -14 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 7 & -7\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186524344 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "416c8e1f-7111-581e-a509-7b34b0a57673" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}15 & 7 & -12 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524330} {:answer/id #uuid "417160ba-08ca-5188-93fa-29957277b5f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 15 & 12 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524331} {:answer/id #uuid "81566d40-fb1d-5a27-8685-3420bcae8beb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}15 & 7 & 12 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524342} {:answer/id #uuid "957414b9-92f6-54f1-8aca-322b35f2cbd1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}15 & 7 & -12 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524345} {:answer/id #uuid "9e8bf4e3-2efc-51b4-8c05-6e39a53fce06" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 15 & 12 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186524348}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186524330} :answer-field/id #uuid "14c9b88d-aec0-5499-b8cd-b8bbd5e43493" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045